      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "EvelynnQ",
        "name": "Hate Spike",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Evelynn strikes out with her Lasher, dealing damage to the first unit hit. Then, Evelynn can shoot a line of spikes at nearby foes a few times.",
        "bodyHtml": "Evelynn strikes with her Lasher, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25/30/35/40/45 + (25% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to the first enemy hit and causing Evelynn's next 3 Attacks or Abilities on that unit to deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(15/25/35/45/55 + (25% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. Evelynn can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability up to 3 times.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast:</span> Evelynn fires spikes through the nearest enemy, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25/30/35/40/45 + (25% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to all enemies hit.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The spikes prioritizes the target Evelynn is attacking.</span>",
