      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "EvelynnW",
        "name": "Allure",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Evelynn curses her target, causing her next attack or spell after a delay to charm her target and reduce their magic resist.",
        "bodyHtml": "Evelynn marks a champion or monster for 5 seconds. If Evelynn hits the target with an Attack or Ability, she will expunge the mark, refund its cost, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> the target by 45% for 0.75 seconds.<br /><br />If the mark lasts at least 2.5 seconds, expunging it has extra effects:<span>Against champions: <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Charms</span> them for 1.25/1.5/1.75/2/2.25 second(s) and removes <span>35/37.5/40/42.5/45% Magic Resist</span> for 4 seconds.<span>Against monsters: <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Charms</span> them for 3/3.25/3.5/3.75/4 seconds and deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(250/300/350/400/450 + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Using this Ability does not remove Evelynn from <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Demon Shade</span>.</span>",
