        "summary": "Evelynn briefly goes untargetable and decimates the area in front of her before warping backwards a long distance.",
        "bodyHtml": "Evelynn unleashes her demonic energy, dealing heavy damage, becoming Untargetable and teleporting backwards. She deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(125/250/375 + (75% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, increased to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(300/600/900 + (180% Ability Power))</span> against enemies below <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">30% Health</span>. Upon cast, set Demon Shade to a 1.25 second cooldown.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Untargetable units won't be affected by enemy Attacks or Abilities unless they've already been hit by them.</span>",
